\par \pard\li175 \cf1 
\par \f4\b All Life Support Systems are gradually available to all Hercs.
\par 
\par Standard\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 Stored vital nutrition and atmosphere allow a seated environment.
\par \b Improved\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 Advances in storage techniques improve performance.
\par \b Integrated\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 limited pseudo-biosphere proves more beneficial to the pilot.
\par \b Total\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96  a comprehensive biosphere not only sustains but improves significantly the Bioderm\'92s internal equilibrium.
\par \b Multishell\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 a series of protective shells decreases the chance of compromising this improved environment
\par \pard\li175 \b Reactive\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 this environment actively protects the status quo, and repairs damaged Bioderm cells.
\par \b Med System\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 Medvat technologies, long too fragile for combat, are partially integrated into environment design.
\par \b Bioenvironment\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 additional Medvat technologies are integrated into the environment.
\par \b Self Repair\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96  environment provides virtually all of the functionality of the Medvat, paired with a highly reactive environment.
\par \b Liquid Life\plain\fs20\cf1  \'96 Bioderm is immersed in a complete nutrition and healing gel.
\par \pard\li175 \plain\f1\fs20 
\par }